<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!-- The launcher needs no entitlement. Without this file Xcode gives it com.apple.application-identifier, which a
     Developer ID signature may carry only with a provisioning profile, and launchd then refuses to start it. -->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict/>
</plist>
